			"date": "2026-11-20T16:53:53.948Z",
			"content": "<p>Great question! It depends on the style. Utility Semibold uses primarily 2px gaps and cutouts between elements, while Font Awesome Classic &amp; Sharp use 1.5px.</p>\n<p>But of course, sometimes an icon marches to the beat of its own pixel grid. 😉</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
